#####system setting#####A
units           lj                                        # all quantities are dimensionless
dimension       3                                         # 3 dimensions                                        
boundary        p p p                                     # periodic boundary condition in all 3 dimensions
atom_style      alive	     		  		  # ellipsoidal particles 

region          box block -50 50 -50 50 -50 50 units box        # define the simulation box
create_box      2 box                                     # only 1 type of atoms are used

create_atoms    1 single 0 0 0

mass		* 1.0

pair_style	soft 1.2
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0
pair_coeff 1 2 0.0
pair_coeff 2 2 0.0


variable atomtype atom type
variable is_alive atom v_atomtype==1

group alive dynamic all var is_alive


fix integrator alive brownian 1e-3 219840 rng uniform gamma_t 1.0 final_integrate
fix bd_compute all birthdeath/rates coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0 0.9 0.001 6.0
fix bd_propagate all birthdeath/simple 1 2 489019 0.7 1


#####run#####
timestep        1e-04
dump            1 all custom 1000 output.dump id type x y z division death
dump_modify     1 sort id        
thermo_style    custom step f_bd_propagate[*]
thermo          1000
log             log.active_dipole
run             1000000





